        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Hours\n- Awards: Pulitzer Prize for Fiction, PEN/Faulkner Award for Fiction, Academy Award for Best Actress\n- Films: The Hours (2002 film)\n- People: Julianne Moore, Nicole Kidman, Meryl Streep\n\nFacts:\n- The novel The Hours won the 1999 Pulitzer Prize for Fiction.\n- The novel The Hours won the 1999 PEN/Faulkner Award for Fiction.\n- The novel The Hours was later adapted into the Oscar-winning 2002 film The Hours.\n- The 2002 film The Hours starred Nicole Kidman, Meryl Streep, and Julianne Moore.\n- Julianne Moore is particularly known for portraying emotionally troubled women in independent and Hollywood films.\n- Julianne Moore received the 2014 Academy Award for Best Actress.",
